{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"6008004010010","name":"霧子","text":"今日に……\r\nなっちゃいました……","trans":"就变成……\n今天这样了……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-7","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……うん","trans":"……嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-8","name":"プロデューサー","text":"先生の宿題のことだったら、\r\n気にしすぎることはないよ","trans":"如果是老师布置的作业，\n不用太在意哦","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004010040","name":"霧子","text":"聴いて……\r\n歌います……","trans":"听着……\n唱歌……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004010050","name":"霧子","text":"霧ちゃんに……\r\nそうする……みたいに……","trans":"就像小雾……\n会做的那样……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-19","name":"プロデューサー","text":"うん","trans":"嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004010060","name":"霧子","text":"それが……\r\nわたしの歌……","trans":"那就是……\n我的歌……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"6008004010070","name":"霧子","text":"みんなの……歌です……","trans":"是大家的……歌……","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}